        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-graphite-fg mb-2">Autoscaling</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-graphite-fg-2 leading-relaxed">Horizontal pod autoscaling, vertical pod autoscaling, cluster autoscaling, event-driven scaling with KEDA, and predictive scaling for known traffic patterns.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-lg border border-graphite-line bg-graphite-2 p-6" data-reveal>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-graphite-fg mb-2">Resilience Patterns</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-graphite-fg-2 leading-relaxed">Retry with exponential backoff, circuit breakers, timeouts, bulkheads, async communication, caching, idempotency, and saga patterns for distributed transactions.</p>
