      <div class="rounded-lg border border-graphite-line bg-graphite-2 p-6" data-reveal>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-graphite-fg mb-2">Caching</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-graphite-fg-2 leading-relaxed">Redis, Memcached, CDN caching, application-level caching, cache-aside, write-through, and cache invalidation strategies for performance optimization.</p>
