      <div class="rounded-lg border border-graphite-line bg-graphite-2 p-6" data-reveal>
        <h3 class="font-display font-semibold text-graphite-fg mb-2">Message Brokers</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-graphite-fg-2 leading-relaxed">Apache Kafka, RabbitMQ, NATS, and cloud-native messaging services. Stream processing, event sourcing, and reliable message delivery at scale.</p>
